Folks,

We had an issue this evening with deployApp() returning the error:

"400 - Validation error: field 'bundle' must be an integer."

This was because of a JSON encoding problem within the shinyapps package. I went ahead and pushed a hotfix <https://github.com/rstudio/shinyapps/commit/124c00be5c7e4dc7f07950609b0b94b478eb239e> for the shinyapps package.

Everyone will need to upgrade this shinyapps using the following command:

devtools::install_github("rstudio/shinyapps")
Thanks
-Andy

